{"2379820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Forty-Niner", "steam_appid": 2379820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/36d0af427eb9931016333d5c2420c8dd.avif?t=1788263317\" width=620 height=167 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the real Gold Rush era that swept across the American frontier, Forty-Niner drops you into a procedurally generated Wild West - no two frontiers, boomtowns, or ghost towns are ever the same. There's no scripted story here: gangs and factions rise out of the towns themselves, taking over territories and shifting as the world keeps moving around you - and the side quests you take can tip the balance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Frontier That Fights Itself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bandit gangs and factions form organically from the towns around you, rising, falling, or taking over territory over time. Every settler follows their own schedule and forms their own opinion of you - help them, trade with them, or cross them, and word travels. Wind down at the saloon for a hand of poker, and watch the frontier's residents live lives of their own, day or night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/26f7191600a2b1afaadf38b93cad9cb8.poster.avif?t=1788263317\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/26f7191600a2b1afaadf38b93cad9cb8.webm?t=1788263317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/26f7191600a2b1afaadf38b93cad9cb8.mp4?t=1788263317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reshape a Procedural Frontier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig tunnels, carve mines, and terraform the land itself. Boomtowns, abandoned mines, and ghost towns look different in every world you generate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/b8d56eddc3c78338085b741d3488cb0b.poster.avif?t=1788263317\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/b8d56eddc3c78338085b741d3488cb0b.webm?t=1788263317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/b8d56eddc3c78338085b741d3488cb0b.mp4?t=1788263317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World in Motion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night brings real danger - bandit raids grow and wildlife becomes more aggressive once the sun goes down. Storms can kill: heavy rain drops the temperature, and fog or dusty storms can cut visibility to nothing if you're caught out unprepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/7356f8d21c9c372d68b131ad214f92d4.poster.avif?t=1788263317\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/7356f8d21c9c372d68b131ad214f92d4.webm?t=1788263317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/7356f8d21c9c372d68b131ad214f92d4.mp4?t=1788263317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From Tent to Train Station</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up a homestead from a canvas tent to a full saloon and working railway, gathering resources from caves, rivers, and the open plains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/1bd874d04bf4fc9be2d8c333067391d6.poster.avif?t=1788263317\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/1bd874d04bf4fc9be2d8c333067391d6.webm?t=1788263317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/1bd874d04bf4fc9be2d8c333067391d6.mp4?t=1788263317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guns, Bows, and Grit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with revolvers, rifles, and bows in real third-person gunfights, customize your loadout, and take down wildlife or rival outlaws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/4a041a0d382a4fd06068c2f182575c5b.poster.avif?t=1788263317\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/4a041a0d382a4fd06068c2f182575c5b.webm?t=1788263317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/4a041a0d382a4fd06068c2f182575c5b.mp4?t=1788263317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live Off the Land</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant and water tomatoes and wheat, hunt and fish for meat, and cook it all over a campfire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Your Outlaw</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character's look, male or female, and grow your skills through the quests and challenges you choose to take on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Host Your Own Frontier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone, or host a world right from your own PC and invite friends to join - no dedicated server required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every outlaw who rides into the frontier is running from something, or looking for it. Uncover why you came, one choice at a time - multiple story endings tied to your reason are planned for the full 1.0 release, with Early Access laying the groundwork first.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Forty-Niner now and follow along as the frontier takes shape.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the real Gold Rush era that swept across the American frontier, Forty-Niner drops you into a procedurally generated Wild West - no two frontiers, boomtowns, or ghost towns are ever the same. There's no scripted story here: gangs and factions rise out of the towns themselves, taking over territories and shifting as the world keeps moving around you - and the side quests you take can tip the balance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Frontier That Fights Itself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bandit gangs and factions form organically from the towns around you, rising, falling, or taking over territory over time. Every settler follows their own schedule and forms their own opinion of you - help them, trade with them, or cross them, and word travels. Wind down at the saloon for a hand of poker, and watch the frontier's residents live lives of their own, day or night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/26f7191600a2b1afaadf38b93cad9cb8.poster.avif?t=1788263317\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/26f7191600a2b1afaadf38b93cad9cb8.webm?t=1788263317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/26f7191600a2b1afaadf38b93cad9cb8.mp4?t=1788263317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reshape a Procedural Frontier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig tunnels, carve mines, and terraform the land itself. Boomtowns, abandoned mines, and ghost towns look different in every world you generate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/b8d56eddc3c78338085b741d3488cb0b.poster.avif?t=1788263317\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/b8d56eddc3c78338085b741d3488cb0b.webm?t=1788263317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/b8d56eddc3c78338085b741d3488cb0b.mp4?t=1788263317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World in Motion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night brings real danger - bandit raids grow and wildlife becomes more aggressive once the sun goes down. Storms can kill: heavy rain drops the temperature, and fog or dusty storms can cut visibility to nothing if you're caught out unprepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/7356f8d21c9c372d68b131ad214f92d4.poster.avif?t=1788263317\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/7356f8d21c9c372d68b131ad214f92d4.webm?t=1788263317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/7356f8d