tag\" >Make Your Outlaw</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character's look, male or female, and grow your skills through the quests and challenges you choose to take on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Host Your Own Frontier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone, or host a world right from your own PC and invite friends to join - no dedicated server required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every outlaw who rides into the frontier is running from something, or looking for it. Uncover why you came, one choice at a time - multiple story endings tied to your reason are planned for the full 1.0 release, with Early Access laying the groundwork first.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Forty-Niner now and follow along as the frontier takes shape.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Reshape a procedurally generated Wild West with your own hands. Dig, farm, craft, fight, and build a homestead from tent to train station. Trade and earn trust with living NPCs who never forget — solo or with friends in the Gold Rush.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/header.jpg?t=1788263317", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788263317", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788263317", "website": "https://forty-niner.net", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400 (2.7 GHz 4 Core) / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X (3.5 GHz 4 Core) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><stro